{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17897","headline":"夏日对雨 · 裴度","name":"夏日对雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登楼逃盛夏，万象正埃尘。\n对面雷嗔树，当街雨趁人。\n檐疎蛛网重，地湿燕泥新。\n吟罢清风起，荷香满四邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}